      "level": "approximate",
      "message": "NGINX rewrites `Location` and `Refresh` headers of backend redirects that point at the `proxy_pass` address (`proxy_redirect default`); ReverseDock passes them unchanged, so a backend that redirects to its own address must use relative or public URLs"
